# Magni App — configuration reference
#
# The mobile app has NO build-time environment variables. All runtime config
# (server URL, auth) is entered by the user in-app on the login screen and is
# stored via Capacitor Preferences.
#
# The only secret involved is CI-side, not in this file:
#
#   KEYSTORE_BASE64  — (GitHub Actions secret) base64-encoded Android signing
#                      keystore. Ensures every build is signed with the same
#                      certificate, so updates install over the previous version
#                      instead of requiring an uninstall first.
#                      Set under: repo → Settings → Secrets and variables →
#                      Actions → New repository secret.
#
# Nothing needs copying to a local .env — this file documents that the app is
# configured at runtime, not at build time.
